{"id":"628100","name":"包菜凉拌荷包蛋","author":"⁶₆ZQY₆⁶","authorId":"12229186","desc":"","cover":"images/628100/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"包菜洗净切块焯水。","img":"images/628100/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"包菜捞出放凉调一个汁：蒜、小米辣、蚝油、香葱、生抽、白芝麻、香醋、麻油、白糖。","img":"images/628100/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热油淋上去。","img":"images/628100/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌。","img":"images/628100/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋到白菜上。","img":"images/628100/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅放油煎几个荷包蛋。","img":"images/628100/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分几个小块倒入和包菜一起搅拌。","img":"images/628100/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开吃！包菜甜甜加上香醋酸酸好吃极了！","img":"images/628100/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}